  "description": "Sandeul is an ordinary college student staying in Australia on a working holiday visa. There’s nothing special about working on a farm, and there’s nothing special about accidentally having a drunken one night stand with the CEO’s son, Lahn, right? Except, there’s nothing ordinary about fleeing a country to escape the guy you had a one night stand with…and having that guy follow you all the way to South Korea. Now, Sandeul’s life is about to become very, very interesting… \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
